        "quote": "(a) The Governing Body shall establish annual goals and objectives for the City Manager within 30 days of completing his or her annual evaluation. To assist the Governing Body with this responsibility, the City Manager may provide the Governing Body with proposed goals and objectives.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.15.100:block:0#text",
